OL,3,AIran's president tells Trump it will
OL,4,Anever 'bend the knee'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran's President Masoud Pezeshkian has
OL,7,Ftold the UN General Assembly that it
OL,8,Fwill never "bend the knee" after almost
OL,9,Fseven months of war with the US and
OL,10,FIsrael, but is ready for a diplomatic
OL,11,Fsolution to the conflict.
OL,13,FResponding to US President Donald
OL,14,FTrump's threat to "annihilate" the
OL,15,FIslamic Republic if a deal is not
OL,16,Freached soon, Pezeshkian said: "He must
OL,17,Fknow that the resistance of the Iranian
OL,18,Fpeople will only increase in the face
OL,19,Fof sanctions, increased pressure,
OL,20,Fincreased bullying."
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
