OL,3,AIran's president tells Trump it will
OL,4,Anever 'bend the knee'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also insisted any deal would have to
OL,7,Finclude an end to the US blockade of
OL,8,FIranian ships and ports.
OL,10,F"It cannot be the case that everyone
OL,11,Fbenefits from the Strait of Hormuz
OL,12,Fwhile we are denied access," he said.
